# Environment variable examples (do not commit real secrets)

Copy values into your shell profile or a local untracked file. Never commit keystores or API keys.

```bash
export JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/java-17-openjdk
export ANDROID_HOME=$HOME/Android/Sdk
export PATH="$PATH:$ANDROID_HOME/platform-tools:$ANDROID_HOME/cmdline-tools/latest/bin"
```

ArenaNet API keys belong in the app UI only — not in this repo.
